{"text":"With respect to the disorderly population, I should say that the International Rescue Commission estimates that there are now 100 million people who are refugees or displaced, and this is the highest number on record. And the sense is that that will continue to happen at pace if we're not able to certainly solve the climate issues that we're dealing with. A number of other things worth highlighting, the debt, sheer amount of debt. I don't really need to say too much about that, given what happened with guilt in the UK, but it's probably worth just estimating or underscoring here that, you know, today over 300% debt to GDP ratio globally. We know many developed economies are at 100% debt to GDP ratios. I think there are a couple of things that are really worth reminding ourselves. Number one, the China leverage factor becomes critical with so much debt out there. By that, I mean China remains, if not the largest, certainly one of the largest foreign lenders to the US government.","words":[{"text":"With","start":0.0,"end":0.72},{"text":"respect","start":0.72,"end":1.18},{"text":"to","start":1.18,"end":1.46},{"text":"the","start":1.46,"end":1.52},{"text":"disorderly","start":1.52,"end":2.02},{"text":"population","start":2.02,"end":2.94,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":3.38,"end":3.38},{"text":"should","start":3.38,"end":3.64},{"text":"say","start":3.64,"end":4.04},{"text":"that","start":4.04,"end":4.48},{"text":"the","start":4.48,"end":4.62},{"text":"International","start":4.62,"end":5.02},{"text":"Rescue","start":5.02,"end":5.82},{"text":"Commission","start":5.82,"end":6.34},{"text":"estimates","start":6.34,"end":6.92},{"text":"that","start":6.92,"end":7.24},{"text":"there","start":7.24,"end":7.38},{"text":"are","start":7.38,"end":7.52},{"text":"now","start":7.52,"end":7.7},{"text":"100","start":7.7,"end":8.3},{"text":"million","start":8.3,"end":8.56},{"text":"people","start":8.56,"end":9.16},{"text":"who","start":9.16,"end":9.7},{"text":"are","start":9.7,"en